+ *     PRDirFlags flags
+ *           PR_SKIP_NONE     Do not skip any files
+ *           PR_SKIP_DOT      Skip the directory entry "." that
+ *                            represents the current directory
+ *           PR_SKIP_DOT_DOT  Skip the directory entry ".." that
+ *                            represents the parent directory.
