+ * NSSCKMDSlot
+ *
+ * This is the basic handle for a PKCS#11 Module Slot.  It is
+ * created by the NSSCKMDInstance->GetSlots call, and may be
+ * obtained from the Framework's corresponding NSSCKFWSlot
