+ */
+
+/*
+ * FUNCTION: PKIX_PolicyNode_GetChildren
+ * DESCRIPTION:
+ *
+ *  Retrieves the List of PolicyNodes representing the child nodes of the
+ *  Policy Node pointed to by "node" and stores it at "pChildren". If "node"
