+/*
+ * FUNCTION: pkix_ComCrlSelParams_RegisterSelf
+ * DESCRIPTION:
+ *  Registers PKIX_COMCRLSELPARAMS_TYPE and its related functions with
+ *  systemClasses[]
+ * THREAD SAFETY:
+ *  Not Thread Safe - for performance and complexity reasons
+ *
